@*
    Inline SVG icon set.

    These are drawn inline rather than pulled from an icon font so the application has no
    extra network dependency and the glyphs inherit the current text colour, which is what
    makes the same icon work on the dark sidebar and on a white card.
*@

<svg class="fc-icon" width="@Size" height="@Size" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
     stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="@StrokeWidth" stroke-linecap="round"
     stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
    @((MarkupString)Path(Name))
</svg>

